      <h1>Who Qualified for the 2026/27 World Darts Championship?</h1>
      <p class="lead-text">
        The 2026/27 PDC World Darts Championship brings together 128 elite competitors inside the historic Great Hall at Alexandra Palace from 11 December 2026 to 3 January 2027. Here is the verified breakdown of all 48 international and secondary qualifying berths, tracking 31 confirmed players, continental debutants, and 17 upcoming playoff spots.
      </p>
      <div class="update-stamp">
        <strong>Status:</strong> 31 Confirmed &bull; 17 TBC &bull; <strong>Last verified:</strong> 27 October 2026 &bull; Main Tour Ranking Cut-Off: 29 November 2026
      </div>
